5,0$ Dikaryophyses unbranched at the apex; hyphae with normal prominent clamp- connexions; spores narrowly elliptic to slightly allantoid and very tardily 1(-3) septate (in some collections ail spores may appear nonseptate), 9.0-12.0 (-16.0} x 3.2-4.0 µm $ D. punctiformii
