9,0$ Spores without conspicuously thickened walls and septa, elliptic to allantoid, 10.2-13.75 (-16.0) x 4.0-4.5 (-5.0) µm, appearing relatively narrow; fruit bodies small, dingy olive or yellow, often with olive tint $ D. Minor

